# Final public presentation and study deliverables are versioned. Temporary
# slide-generation state and release archives remain below ignored build/.
presentation/final/.work/
presentation/final/prompts/
presentation/final/drafts/
# 발표 영상과 배포 ZIP은 GitHub Release 자산으로 제공하고 Git 이력에는 넣지 않는다.
presentation/final/**/*.mp4
presentation/final/**/*.gif
presentation/final/*.mp4
presentation/final/*.gif
release/*.zip
study/.build/
paper/final/*.html
paper/final/*_plaintext.txt
paper/final/*_pdf_text.txt
paper/technical_report/*.html
paper/technical_report/*_plaintext.txt
paper/technical_report/*_pdf_text.txt

# Evidence is intentionally versioned. Only transient run work is ignored.
